&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#our-friends&#34; &gt;Our Friends&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;overview&#34;&gt;Overview
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;RomM (ROM Manager) allows you to scan, enrich, browse and play your game collection with a clean and responsive interface. With support for multiple platforms, various naming schemes, and custom tags, RomM is a must-have for anyone who plays on emulators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;features&#34;&gt;Features
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scans and enhance your game library with metadata from &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.romm.app/latest/Getting-Started/Metadata-Providers/#igdb&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;IGDB&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.romm.app/latest/Getting-Started/Metadata-Providers/#screenscraper&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Screenscraper&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.romm.app/latest/Getting-Started/Metadata-Providers/#mobygames&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;MobyGames&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fetch custom arwork from &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.romm.app/latest/Getting-Started/Metadata-Providers/#steamgriddb&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;SteamGridDB&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Display your achievements from &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.romm.app/latest/Getting-Started/Metadata-Providers/#retroachievements&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Retroachievements&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Metadata available for &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.romm.app/latest/Platforms-and-Players/Supported-Platforms/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;400+ platforms&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play games directly from the browser using &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.romm.app/latest/Platforms-and-Players/EmulatorJS-Player/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;EmulatorJS&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.romm.app/latest/Platforms-and-Players/RuffleRS-Player/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;RuffleRS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share your library with friends with limited access and permissions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Official apps for &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/rommapp/playnite-plugin&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Playnite&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/rommapp/muos-app&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;muOS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supports multi-disk games, DLCs, mods, hacks, patches, and manuals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parse and filter by &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.romm.app/latest/Getting-Started/Folder-Structure/#tag-support&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;tags&lt;/a&gt; in filenames&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;View, upload, update, and delete games from any modern web browser&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;preview&#34;&gt;Preview
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;table&gt;
	&lt;thead&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;th style=&#34;text-align: center&#34;&gt;🖥 Desktop&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th style=&#34;text-align: center&#34;&gt;📱 Mobile&lt;/th&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/thead&gt;
	&lt;tbody&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td style=&#34;text-align: center&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;.github/resources/screenshots/preview-desktop.webp&#34; alt=&#34;desktop preview&#34; /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td style=&#34;text-align: center&#34;&gt;&lt;img style=&#34;width: 325px; aspect-ratio: auto;&#34; src=&#34;.github/resources/screenshots/preview-mobile.webp&#34; alt=&#34;mobile preview&#34; /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;installation&#34;&gt;Installation
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;To start using RomM, check out the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.romm.app/latest/Getting-Started/Quick-Start-Guide/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Quick Start Guide&lt;/a&gt; in the docs. If you are having issues with RomM, please review the page for &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.romm.app/latest/Troubleshooting/Scanning-Issues/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;troubleshooting steps&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;contributing&#34;&gt;Contributing
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;To contribute to RomM, please check &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;./CONTRIBUTING.md&#34; &gt;Contribution Guide&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;community&#34;&gt;Community
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here are a few projects maintained by members of our community. Please note that the RomM team does not regularly review their source code.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/idio-sync/romm-comm&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;romm-comm&lt;/a&gt;: Discord Bot by @idio-sync&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/PeriBluGaming/DeckRommSync-Standalone&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;DeckRommSync&lt;/a&gt;: SteamOS downloader and sync by @PeriBluGaming&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/smurflabs/RommBrowser/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;RommBrowser&lt;/a&gt;: An electron client for RomM by @smurflabs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CasaOS app via the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/bigbeartechworld/big-bear-casaos&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;BigBear App Store&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us on Discord, where you can ask questions, submit ideas, get help, showcase your collection, and discuss RomM with other users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://discord.gg/P5HtHnhUDH&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://invidget.switchblade.xyz/P5HtHnhUDH&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;discord-invite-img&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;technical-support&#34;&gt;Technical Support
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you have any issues with RomM, please &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/rommapp/romm/issues/new&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;open an issue&lt;/a&gt; in this repository.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;project-support&#34;&gt;Project Support
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Consider supporting the development of this project on Open Collective.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://opencollective.com/romm&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://opencollective.com/romm/donate/button.png?color=blue&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;oc-donate-img&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;our-friends&#34;&gt;Our Friends
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here are a few projects that we think you might like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://emulatorjs.org/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;EmulatorJS&lt;/a&gt;: An embeddable, browser-based emulator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://retrodeck.net/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;RetroDECK&lt;/a&gt;: Retro gaming on SteamOS and Linux&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://es-de.org/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;ES-DE Frontend&lt;/a&gt;: Emulator frontend for Linux, macOS and Windows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/gaseous-project/gaseous-server&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Gaseous&lt;/a&gt;: Another ROM manager with web-based emulator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/JMBeresford/retrom&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Retrom&lt;/a&gt;: A centralized game library/collection management service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://steamgriddb.github.io/steam-rom-manager/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Steam ROM Manager&lt;/a&gt;: An app for managing ROMs in Steam&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
